WEBVTT

00:11:25.663 --> 00:11:31.830
So it won't be long before
non-African products are less desirable

00:11:31.863 --> 00:11:34.763
than the ones that we make here at home.

00:11:34.797 --> 00:11:39.063
So if you want in, great, come join us.

00:11:39.063 --> 00:11:40.997
But do it thoughtfully,

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:42.930
do it intentionally,

00:11:42.963 --> 00:11:44.863
spend the money,

00:11:44.897 --> 00:11:47.930
and for goodness sake,
don't underestimate us.

00:11:48.397 --> 00:11:50.097
Don't underestimate me.

00:11:50.997 --> 00:11:52.163
Thank you.